# dnsmasq.hosts — canonical "what resolves to what" for the lab.
#
# Format: one entry per line, `<IP>  <hostname> [hostname ...]`.
# This file is the ONLY source of DNS for workstations (no upstream
# forwarding). Anything not listed here NXDOMAINs.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Lab containers
# Workstations used to get these via Docker's embedded DNS. Since we
# override their /etc/resolv.conf to point at lab_dns, we have to provide
# them here. If you add a new lab container that workstations talk to,
# add it here too.
10.10.0.2     kali
10.10.0.3     router
10.30.0.4     router-internal
10.40.0.4     router-dmz
10.40.0.2     apache
10.30.0.6     db-internal

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Fake "internet" — workstation outbound baseline
# Real-looking public domains that workstations browse, query, or
# package-manage. All resolve to the single fake_internet container,
# which serves nginx with a multi-SAN cert covering every name below.
# fake_internet listens on :80 (apt repo metadata) AND :443 (everything
# else), so the workstation traffic shape is realistic.

# Package mirrors — `apt update`, `apt list --upgradable`.
10.10.0.11    archive.ubuntu.com
10.10.0.11    security.ubuntu.com

# npm / GitHub / GitHub content — developer-persona outbound.
10.10.0.11    registry.npmjs.org
10.10.0.11    github.com
10.10.0.11    api.github.com
10.10.0.11    raw.githubusercontent.com

# Corporate messaging — sysadmin + clinical baseline.
10.10.0.11    slack.com
10.10.0.11    api.slack.com

# Connectivity / NTP-style probes — modern Linux distros constantly
# poll these to detect captive portals + time drift.
10.10.0.11    connectivity-check.ubuntu.com
10.10.0.11    time.cloudflare.com

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Corporate intranet
# Pretend internal Waystar resource that Luke (clinical) periodically
# checks. Routes back to apache (the DMZ web tier) so it shares the
# real CGI + booking infrastructure — also gives an internal-DMZ
# baseline flow that's separate from the external-domain shape.
10.40.0.2     intranet.waystar.local
